SUMMARY:June Softball Skills Camp at Penn Medicine Park
DESCRIPTION:This 3-day Youth Softball Camp is designed to be high-energy\, fun\, and skill-focused for players ages 7–14. Each day blends age-appropriate instruction with competitive games to help players build confidence while developing strong fundamentals. \nPlayers will work on throwing\, catching\, hitting\, base running\, and defensive skills\, with drills tailored to each age group and ability level. Our coaches break skills down simply\, reinforce proper mechanics\, and create a positive environment where players are encouraged to learn\, compete\, and enjoy the game. \nCamp sessions include skill stations\, small-group instruction\, team competitions\, and game play\, ensuring every athlete stays engaged and active. Whether your player is new to softball or looking to sharpen their skills\, this camp provides a supportive setting focused on long-term development\, confidence\, and love for the game. \nJoin us for exciting\, skill-building softball camps where players of all levels will enhance their abilities in every aspect of the game! \nParticipants will focus on key fundamentals such as hitting\, pitching\, fielding\, base running\, and throwing. Through instruction from the Stormers Softball coaching staff and fun drills\, players will progressively build their skills and gain confidence on the field\, setting the foundation for success in competitive play. Train like the Stormers! \nSoftball Camps are run by Jackie Wardrop and Brionna Rinier! \nRuns: 9:00 am – 12:00 Noon \n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/june-softball-skills-camp-penn-medicine-park/
