SUMMARY:Date Night In Amish Country with Strasburg Scooter Tours
DESCRIPTION:You’ll be head over heels as you and your date cruise through scenic country roads with our expert guides\, followed by dinner at a local watering hole*. It’s a fun activity that’s unique to Lancaster\, PA and romantic. Looking for other unique date ideas? View our list of unique things to do in Lancaster\, PA\, for couples. And while we can’t promise a sunset view over rolling farmland\, we can tell you that locals and visitors alike enjoy this date activity in Lancaster\, PA. Looking for unique weekend activities to complement your tour? View 8 things to do on a Sunday in Lancaster\, PA. \nItinerary\nEach trip is unique\, so you never know what we might have in store for you! \nTours include: \n\nA quick guided tour through the countryside and local\, covered bridges of Lancaster County\n\nA certificate for mini-golf at nearby Village Greens or a $25 certificate to your choice of Fireside Tavern or beSpoke Brewing. Book Now. * \n*Guests have their choice of passes for miniature golf and ice cream at Village Greens where each guest will receive a pass\, or guests can receive their choice of a $25 gift card to Fireside Tavern or Bespoke Brewing\, where they’ll receive one gift card per couple (2 guests).
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/strasburg-scooter-tours-date-night/2026-06-18/
