SUMMARY:Jo Dee Messina at American Music Theatre
DESCRIPTION:With powerhouse vocals\, undeniable stage presence\, and a string of chart-topping hits\, Jo Dee Messina remains one of country music’s most vibrant and beloved artists. From the moment she burst onto the scene with “Heads Carolina\, Tails California\,” Jo Dee has delivered anthems that defined an era and continue to connect with fans across generations. \nHer impressive career includes timeless favorites like “I’m Alright\,” “Bye-Bye\,” “Lesson in Leavin’\,” and “Stand Beside Me\,” along with multiple Platinum albums and CMA and ACM Award wins. Known for her high-energy shows and heartfelt storytelling\, Jo Dee’s live performances are a celebration of life\, love\, and resilience. \nDon’t miss this unforgettable evening with one of country music’s most powerful voices! \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
